# The image is built from Warhammer/ (the app), Warhammer.Tests/ (run against
# the exported data before publishing) and docker/ (nginx config, export
# helper) only. Everything else is excluded so tools, docs and local build
# output never enter the build context or bust the layer cache.
*
!Warhammer/
!Warhammer.Tests/
!docker/

**/bin/
**/obj/
Warhammer/docs/
**/*.user
